WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.320
- I did a lot of weird,

00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:03.760
I like sold Time Life
books over the phone.

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:05.490
I sold steaks.

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:06.470
- Steaks, Omaha steaks?

00:00:06.470 --> 00:00:08.930
- Omaha steaks is where I worked, yeah.

00:00:08.930 --> 00:00:10.810
It would be a lot of me.

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:12.480
- Is that like, how do you sell that?

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:13.350
Mine was easier.

00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:15.680
- I would call and my main
thing, it's so stupid,

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:16.930
I would take a piece of paper

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:18.420
and this was like my closer,

00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:21.400
I would wiggle the piece of
paper in front of my face,

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:23.030
which is where the headset was,

00:00:23.030 --> 00:00:26.260
and then I go, sorry, excuse
me, my manager's here.

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:27.093
What's that?

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:28.180
No, I can't, really?

00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:29.370
No.

00:00:29.370 --> 00:00:30.610
What?

00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:32.960
And then I get back and
I'm like, I'm so sorry,

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:34.380
I can't believe this is happening,

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:37.430
but this just came in from upstairs.

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:39.320
One floor building.

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:41.340
This came in from upstairs,

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:44.058
we're gonna cut the price
of those filets by half.

00:00:44.058 --> 00:00:47.120
(laughing)

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:49.810
I can't believe we're doing this!

00:00:49.810 --> 00:00:51.944
And then people are like,

00:00:51.944 --> 00:00:53.044
everyone wants a deal.

